# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 OR MIT
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use jspassgen-sdk-java in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "jspassgen-sdk-java: a native Java port of the jspassgen core"
abstract: >-
  A native Java port of the jspassgen password and passphrase
  core, drawing randomness only from SecureRandom, to be proven against
  jspassgen by its conformance kit. Version 0.0.22 holds the random
  source only; the generators are not ported yet.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
version: "0.0.22"
license:
  - Apache-2.0
  - MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/jspassgen-sdk-java"
url: "https://jspassgen.com"
keywords:
  - password
  - passphrase
  - CSPRNG
  - SecureRandom
  - Java
  - SDK
